// Outturn (real terms) by financial year and department of the current structure, every cell: each year's amount is
// deflated with the index of that year, so the departments of one year share one factor and a department's total over
// years is the sum of its deflated years. Expected values: the fact on the same keys times the year's factor.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Department (current structure)'[Department Number],
    "outturn", [Outturn],
    "outturn_real", [Outturn (real terms)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Department (current structure)'[Department Number]
